  "continuity_rule": "Build the ring on the vertex grid as a 4-connected band at least 2 vertices thick (dilate the inside-ellipse boundary with a cross). Keep a straight 2-vertex run of >=5 tiles each side of every gate, right up to the passage. Tie each E/W run end to the nearest ring vertex with a dilated connector. Then de-saddle: any tile whose frame is 5 or 10 has all 4 corners set. Result: only edge, full and inner/outer 45deg frames, so the wall is continuous. Only tiles wholly inside a gate sprite are hidden. Watchtowers snap to the nearest full (15) palisade tile: centre x = tile+8, base = tile y+18."
